{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00209","headline":"幸华严寺 · 宣宗皇帝","name":"幸华严寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云散晴山几万重，烟收春色更冲融。\n帐殿出空登碧汉，遐川俯望色蓝笼。\n林光入户低韶景，岭气通宵展霁风。\n今日追游何所似，莫慙汉武赏汾中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宣宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00209.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00209","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}